{"ticker":"APP","updated":"2026-10-23T22:38:04Z","profile":{"longName":"AppLovin Corporation","shortName":"Applovin Corporation","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Advertising Agencies","country":"United States","website":"https://www.applovin.com","fullTimeEmployees":876,"marketCap":87428259840,"trailingPE":20.003843,"forwardPE":12.679252,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":12.802265,"pegRatio":0.57,"targetMeanPrice":476.85193,"targetHighPrice":790.0,"targetLowPrice":325.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":31,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.528,"earningsGrowth":0.57,"grossMargins":0.88464,"operatingMargins":0.77678,"profitMargins":0.64575994,"totalRevenue":6829124096,"beta":2.557,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":738.01,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":258.3201,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"AppLovin Corporation provides end-to-end artificial intelligence-powered advertising solutions for businesses in the United States and internationally. It operates through two segments, Advertising and Apps. The company offers Axon Ads Manager, a suite of marketing solutions that enables developers to automate, optimize, and manage marketing efforts; MAX, an in-app bidding technology that optimizes the value of a publisher's advertising inventory by running a real-time competitive auction; Adjust, a measurement and analytics marketing platform; and Wurl, a connected TV platform, which distributes streaming video for content companies, provides advertising and publishing solutions. It serves individuals, small and independent businesses, enterprises, advertisers and advertising networks, mobile app publishers, and indie studio developers. The company was incorporated in 2011 and is headquartered in Palo Alto, California.","summary_zh":"AppLovin Corporation 為美國和國際企業提供端到端人工智慧驅動的廣告解決方案。它透過兩個部門運作：廣告部門和應用程式部門。該公司提供 Axon Ads Manager，這是一套行銷解決方案，使開發人員能夠自動化、優化和管理行銷工作； MAX，一種應用程式內競價技術，透過運行即時競爭性拍賣來優化發布商廣告庫存的價值； Adjust，一個測量和分析行銷平台； Wurl 是一個聯網電視平台，為內容公司分發串流媒體影片，提供廣告和發布解決方案。它為個人、小型和獨立企業、企業、廣告商和廣告網路、行動應用程式發行商以及獨立工作室開發人員提供服務。該公司成立於 2011 年，總部位於加州帕洛阿爾托。","sector_zh":"通訊服務","industry_zh":"廣告公司","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":440.3,"h":454.39,"l":434.02,"c":450.68,"v":4018600},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":448.01,"h":471.92,"l":444.0,"c":469.33,"v":5593700},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":469.0,"h":474.98,"l":458.65,"c":462.94,"v":2968600},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":463.2,"h":488.7,"l":463.0,"c":483.75,"v":5898500},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":480.72,"h":485.528,"l":472.42,"c":478.59,"v":5148100},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":464.0,"h":481.86,"l":452.25,"c":481.73,"v":5279100},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":487.69,"h":499.87,"l":485.08,"c":487.35,"v":5052300},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":497.8,"h":511.0,"l":490.658,"c":499.97,"v":6215200},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":506.0,"h":507.87,"l":469.8,"c":490.24,"v":8290500},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":537.075,"h":555.5,"l":535.7,"c":547.04,"v":16516900},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":546.815,"h":559.24,"l":544.923,"c":558.17,"v":8503500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":562.83,"h":576.01,"l":561.5,"c":567.12,"v":6730300},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":568.0,"h":576.44,"l":560.79,"c":571.31,"v":6133500},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":573.055,"h":587.88,"l":572.11,"c":582.0,"v":6730300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":578.54,"h":595.27,"l":574.227,"c":593.14,"v":6246600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":596.7,"h":605.38,"l":589.28,"c":603.8,"v":8588900},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":603.57,"h":613.69,"l":587.23,"c":606.66,"v":8915200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":616.325,"h":632.881,"l":613.78,"c":621.52,"v":9258500},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":628.48,"h":653.06,"l":617.56,"c":649.59,"v":73131600},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":647.05,"h":657.0,"l":639.515,"c":643.5,"v":9307100},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":641.0,"h":670.189,"l":637.51,"c":651.18,"v":7799900},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":652.75,"h":662.499,"l":635.5,"c":641.92,"v":5991500},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":624.87,"h":643.924,"l":619.49,"c":639.91,"v":6418200},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":652.67,"h":671.18,"l":646.47,"c":669.86,"v":6122400},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":685.4,"h":745.61,"l":683.5,"c":712.36,